=== START LOG: 12_gnn_tuned.py [2026-10-17 12:18:29] ===

=========================================================================================================
12_gnn_tuned.py — D-MPNN with hyperparameter search inside every outer fold (nested)
=========================================================================================================

~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
[EXPLAIN] What this step does
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  Step 09 evaluated the D-MPNN with default settings, which a reviewer can fairly call under-
  tuned. Here the network gets         the same treatment as the classical models: inside each
  outer training set, 8 configurations (hidden size,         message-passing depth and dropout)
  are compared on a held-out 20% of that training set, the best one is retrained on the
  whole training set, and only then it predicts the outer test fold. The outer folds are the same
  as in steps 01 and 09, so         the results can be compared fold by fold. The default
  configuration is part of the grid.
